---
/**
 * The one playground for acts 01 and 02.
 *
 * Chrome is HTML — screens and workspaces open and close on a real width /
 * height the way the Features playground does. The stage stays SVG: type,
 * generate, live widgets. Boards are packed like the real desk — tables,
 * axes, tape, heatmaps — not candy tiles. As #app-showcase takes the pin
 * the generate loop parks, a mosaic bound draws, and Links wire the same
 * widgets. Boards then cycle (personal, trading, quake, watchlist, news).
 * Chrome keeps cycling through both acts.
 */
import { ICON_PATHS } from '../icon-paths';

